  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "CameraUBO manages the WebGL Uniform Buffer Object (UBO) responsible for transmitting camera transformation data (view and projection matrices) from the CPU to the GPU. It encapsulates the necessary WebGL buffer and a Float32Array, initializing the buffer to bind to global binding point 0. The primary function, update(), efficiently pushes the latest view and projection matrices to the GPU buffer every frame for rendering consistency."
  },
